# Quintessential Katana: "Whenever a Ninja you control enters, you may attach this Equipment to it." Bot1 casts the Katana,
# then Blade-Blizzard Kitsune (a Fox Ninja, 2/2 double strike) and accepts: it is a 3/3. On T3 it attacks and deals combat
# damage in both steps (CR 510.4), so the granted "untap it and you gain 2 life" triggers in each: Bot2 20 - 3 - 3 = 14, Bot1
# 20 + 2 + 2 = 24, and the Kitsune ends untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Quintessential Katana
Blade-Blizzard Kitsune
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Quintessential Katana.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Blade-Blizzard Kitsune.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Battlefield.Quintessential Katana.AttachedTo = Blade-Blizzard Kitsune
? Bot1.Battlefield.Blade-Blizzard Kitsune.Power = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Blade-Blizzard Kitsune.Toughness = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Blade-Blizzard Kitsune > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot1.Life = 24
Bot1.Battlefield.Blade-Blizzard Kitsune.Tapped = false
